명조,한컴돋움\">1,000,000</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"635\" colspan=\"10\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">※ 납부기간내에 미등록자는 별도의 통보없이 합격 취소하고 차순위자 선발함. </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"166\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">◐ 선착순 신청 </span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"469\" colspan=\"7\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;2010. 8. 4(수) 원스톱서비스(예정)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">➡ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">개사기간 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 2010. 8. 30(월) ～ 12. 21(화) 12시 까지(113일)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">➡ 합격자 확인 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">원스톱서비스에 로그인하여 합격 여부 확인 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">➡ 납부고지서 출력 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">원스톱서비스에 로그인하여 출력</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">➡ 납부장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">농협중앙회 전국지점(단위농협 포함) 및 학교 농협</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">➡</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 주의사항</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">공용 PC실을 이용할 경우 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">ActiveX를 다운받아 설치</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">하여야만 신청페이지가 실행되오니 PC자체설정 권한을 Administrator로 설정하여 반드시 ActiveX를 다운로드 받아 이용하시기 바랍니다.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">※ 공용PC실의 경우 반드시 PC 관리자 확인 바람)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">➡ 학번이 부여되지 않은 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">대학원 신입생</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">은 생활관 행정실에서 2010. 7. 7(수)～7. 9(금)까지 신청바라며, 합격자는 생활관비 고지서를 생활관 행정실에서 수령하여 은행에 납부 하여 주십시요.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">➡ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">생활관</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">장 추천대상자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">〔서류제출자도 인터넷 접수(</span><a href=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">www.kumoh.ac.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 원스톱서비스)를 신청해야 함〕</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 6pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">생활관장</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">의 추천을 받고자 하는 학생은 그 내용을 증명할 수 있는 아래 서류를 2010.&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">6. 28(월)～6. 30(수)까지</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">생활관 행정실</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">로 제출</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(우편 가능)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">① 국민기초생활보장법에 의한 수급자증명서</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">② 소년․소녀 가장(세대원)증명서</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">③ 장애인 증명서</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">④ 국가유공자(유족)확인원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">※ 서류 제출자는 추천 범위 내에서 신청자 전체 남, 여 구분하여 성적순으로 선발.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">➡</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 1인실(기존관 8명)을 이용하고자 할 경우 신청기간에 행정실(식당 2층)에서 신청.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(대학원생 우선 배정)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">➡ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">입사 대상자 제출서류</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">미제출자는 퇴사조치 함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;생활관 입사하는 전 관생은</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;①</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">결핵</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 및 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">B형 간염</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 2가지만</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">검진한 검사결과서(소견서) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;▸ 간염검사에서 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">항원이 양성일 경우</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 병원(내과)에서 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">활동성 또는 비활동성 여부에 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;대해 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">추가 검사한 결과서를 제출하여야 함.</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">비활동성 보균자는 입사할 수 있음</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;▸</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1학기에 제출한 건강진단서는 재활용</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(항체 : 양성, 항원 : 음성일 경우만)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;② 주민등록등본 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">③ 입사할 때 자치회에서 배부하는 생활관 입사 설문지(호실 비품 수령 List) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">������ 열쇠&nbsp;보관금을 환불받을 본인의 계좌번호 필히 명기</sp